        "original_id": "10edffc7-68bf-5cba-a6b9-f24da0fba4c8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cass Elliot, Leah Kunkel, Marty Gwinn Townsend, Renee Armand\n- Organizations: Coyote Sisters, the Mamas & the Papas\n\nFacts:\n- Cass Elliot was born Ellen Naomi Cohen on September 19, 1941, and she died on July 29, 1974.\n- Cass Elliot, also known as Mama Cass, was an American singer and actress.\n- Cass Elliot was best known as a member of the Mamas & the Papas.\n- Coyote Sisters is an American pop-rock female trio formed in 1980.\n- Coyote Sisters has included Leah Kunkel, Marty Gwinn Townsend, and Renee Armand as its members.\n- Leah Kunkel is the younger sister of Cass Elliot.",
